{
    "title": "Fax.Plus - Send Fax from Phone",
    "description": "<b>Fax.Plus</b> - Best Rated Online Fax Service to send and receive fax from Android phone or tablet. It\u2019s easy, fast, reliable, and secure.\r\nWith Fax.Plus you can securely send free fax from your Android phone and receive faxes in your encrypted archive. First 10 pages are free. \r\n\r\n\u2605 <b>Fax.Plus recognized as the best online fax service!</b> \u2605\r\n\r\n<b>Send fax from phone:</b> Fax.Plus Android app enables you to send faxes from anywhere, anytime and from any device without the need to have a fax machine, landline phone service, or any other specific equipment. To prepare the documents, you can either use the phone\u2019s camera to scan documents or import the documents from local storage or cloud storage such as Google Drive or Dropbox.\r\n\r\n<b>Receive fax in your phone:</b> You can get a dedicated fax number from over 40 countries to receive fax online on your Android phone. You will be notified with a push notification when there is new fax in your inbox. \r\n\r\n<b>Encrypted archive:</b> All sent and received faxes are stored in a fully encrypted archive for your future reference.\r\n\r\n<b>Sign documents on the go:</b> The electronic signature feature makes it easier than ever to sign documents and fax them back without even printing a single page.\r\n\r\n<b>Scan documents with mobile camera:</b> Our free and secure online faxing solution gets the most out of your device\u2019s camera and scans your physical documents and turn them into fax-ready documents. Automatic document detection, border cropping, and perspective correctness are some of the features of our powerful scanner.\r\n\r\n<b>HIPAA compliance:</b> Activate advanced security controls and start faxing online with ease while staying fully compliant with HIPAA. \r\n\r\n\r\n<u><b>Fax.Plus features and advantages:</b></u>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Send and receive faxes anytime and anywhere\r\n\u2022 Send fax from email\r\n\u2022 HIPAA Compliant faxing *\r\n\u2022 Programmable fax API\r\n\u2022 Cross-platform faxing solution\r\n\u2022 Scan documents with your mobile camera (automatic document detection, magnifier, border cropping, perspective correctness)\r\n\u2022 Add documents from your device or your cloud storage (Google Drive and Dropbox)\r\n\u2022 Add a cover page to your fax with \u2018Add Text\u2019 feature\r\n\u2022  Support many document formats: Office documents, PDF, JPG, PNG, TIFF\r\n\u2022 Sign your documents and faxes and send them back without printing them\r\n\u2022 Forward, reply or resend your faxes to any fax machine\r\n\u2022 Send fax to your contacts \r\n\u2022 Organize your fax archive by adding notes to your sent and received faxes\r\n\u2022 Schedule your fax to be sent at a defined date and time\r\n\u2022 Enable the Retry for failed faxes to ensure maximum delivery rate. \r\n\u2022 Receive notification of your sent and received faxes to your email address. Add up to 5 emails.\r\n\u2022 Send fax to a Human-Operated Telefax: Your destination contact will hear a prerecorded message stating: \"This is a fax call, to receive please press start.\"\r\n\r\n<b>Worldwide coverage:</b>\r\nYou can send faxes locally and internationally to more than 180 countries! And if you need to receive faxes, you can get a number from the United States, Canada, South Africa, Portugal, Germany, and many more countries. Check the list of 40+ locations currently available on our website. \r\n\r\n<b>Fax.Plus pricing and plans:</b>\r\nFax.Plus provides a free plan that allows you to fax up to 10 pages!\r\nEntrepreneur, Professional or Company? Take a look at our range of plans to find the one that fits you best! Our range of plans start at $6.99 / month and allows you to get a local fax number from over 40 countries from which you can receive and send faxes to over 180 countries.\r\nhttps://www.fax.plus/pricing.\r\n\r\n* Fax.Plus is HIPAA compliant, provided the user has advanced security controls activated and enters into a business associate agreement (BAA) with Fax.Plus. Advanced security controls are available on the Enterprise plan tier.\r\n\r\nAny further questions or requests? Do not hesitate to reach us on our website, app or by email at support@fax.plus. Our customer support team will be pleased to help you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Fax.Plus</b> - Best Rated Online Fax Service to send and receive fax from Android phone or tablet. It\u2019s easy, fast, reliable, and secure.<br>With Fax.Plus you can securely send free fax from your Android phone and receive faxes in your encrypted archive. First 10 pages are free. <br><br>\u2605 <b>Fax.Plus recognized as the best online fax service!</b> \u2605<br><br><b>Send fax from phone:</b> Fax.Plus Android app enables you to send faxes from anywhere, anytime and from any device without the need to have a fax machine, landline phone service, or any other specific equipment. To prepare the documents, you can either use the phone\u2019s camera to scan documents or import the documents from local storage or cloud storage such as Google Drive or Dropbox.<br><br><b>Receive fax in your phone:</b> You can get a dedicated fax number from over 40 countries to receive fax online on your Android phone. You will be notified with a push notification when there is new fax in your inbox. <br><br><b>Encrypted archive:</b> All sent and received faxes are stored in a fully encrypted archive for your future reference.<br><br><b>Sign documents on the go:</b> The electronic signature feature makes it easier than ever to sign documents and fax them back without even printing a single page.<br><br><b>Scan documents with mobile camera:</b> Our free and secure online faxing solution gets the most out of your device\u2019s camera and scans your physical documents and turn them into fax-ready documents. Automatic document detection, border cropping, and perspective correctness are some of the features of our powerful scanner.<br><br><b>HIPAA compliance:</b> Activate advanced security controls and start faxing online with ease while staying fully compliant with HIPAA. <br><br><br><u><b>Fax.Plus features and advantages:</b></u><br><br>\u2022 Send and receive faxes anytime and anywhere<br>\u2022 Send fax from email<br>\u2022 HIPAA Compliant faxing *<br>\u2022 Programmable fax API<br>\u2022 Cross-platform faxing solution<br>\u2022 Scan documents with your mobile camera (automatic document detection, magnifier, border cropping, perspective correctness)<br>\u2022 Add documents from your device or your cloud storage (Google Drive and Dropbox)<br>\u2022 Add a cover page to your fax with \u2018Add Text\u2019 feature<br>\u2022  Support many document formats: Office documents, PDF, JPG, PNG, TIFF<br>\u2022 Sign your documents and faxes and send them back without printing them<br>\u2022 Forward, reply or resend your faxes to any fax machine<br>\u2022 Send fax to your contacts <br>\u2022 Organize your fax archive by adding notes to your sent and received faxes<br>\u2022 Schedule your fax to be sent at a defined date and time<br>\u2022 Enable the Retry for failed faxes to ensure maximum delivery rate. <br>\u2022 Receive notification of your sent and received faxes to your email address. Add up to 5 emails.<br>\u2022 Send fax to a Human-Operated Telefax: Your destination contact will hear a prerecorded message stating: &quot;This is a fax call, to receive please press start.&quot;<br><br><b>Worldwide coverage:</b><br>You can send faxes locally and internationally to more than 180 countries! And if you need to receive faxes, you can get a number from the United States, Canada, South Africa, Portugal, Germany, and many more countries. Check the list of 40+ locations currently available on our website. <br><br><b>Fax.Plus pricing and plans:</b><br>Fax.Plus provides a free plan that allows you to fax up to 10 pages!<br>Entrepreneur, Professional or Company? Take a look at our range of plans to find the one that fits you best! Our range of plans start at $6.99 / month and allows you to get a local fax number from over 40 countries from which you can receive and send faxes to over 180 countries.<br>https://www.fax.plus/pricing.<br><br>* Fax.Plus is HIPAA compliant, provided the user has advanced security controls activated and enters into a business associate agreement (BAA) with Fax.Plus. Advanced security controls are available on the Enterprise plan tier.<br><br>Any further questions or requests? Do not hesitate to reach us on our website, app or by email at support@fax.plus. Our customer support team will be pleased to help you!",
